<div class="component row  justify-content-start crmt-4 ">
  <div class="col-md-7">

  
  
<div class="component title">
  <h2 id="trading-holiday-hours" class="title-text none None">
    
      Globex Trading Hours and Holiday Schedules
      
    
  </h2>
</div>

  

</div>
<div class="col-md-5">

  
  
  

</div>

</div>


<div class="component row  justify-content-start   ">
  <div class="col-md-9">

  
  <div class="cmp cmp-text">
<div class="component react text">
  <div path="text">
    
      <p>Please note that with the 2026 and 2027 calendar year the CME Group will be providing downloadable holiday calendars for Globex and incorporating with Regular Trading hours into one location. To view the trading hours for a specific holiday please select the appropriate date in the “DATE” field and the data will automatically update in the table below the date field. You can then filter for the various products that you need to view. To view the trading hours for the next upcoming holiday you can click on the “View trading hours for (holiday name)” link that appears to the right of the date field.</p>

    
  </div>
</div>

    


  



</div>

  

</div>
<div class="col-md-3">

  
  
  

</div>

</div>


<div class="component row  justify-content-start crmt-3 ">
  <div class="col d-none d-md-block">

  
  

<div class="component row  medium-gutters justify-content-start None ">
  <div class="col-md-7">

  
  

<div class="component row  medium-gutters justify-content-start None ">
  <div class="col-md-4">

  
  <div class="cmp cmp-text">
<div class="component react text">
  <div path="text">
    
      <h6><span class="th-dot halt"></span>PREOPEN</h6>
<p><span class="text4"><span class="text-averta-light">Order Entry, modification, and cancel are allowed. No order matching.</span></span></p>

    
  </div>
</div>

    


  



</div>

  

</div>
<div class="col-md-4">

  
  <div class="cmp cmp-text">
<div class="component react text">
  <div path="text">
    
      <h6><span class="th-dot open"></span>OPEN</h6>
<p><span class="text4"><span class="text-averta-light">Start of continuous trading phase. Order matching begins.</span></span></p>

    
  </div>
</div>

    


  



</div>

  

</div>
<div class="col-md-4">

  
  <div class="cmp cmp-text">
<div class="component react text">
  <div path="text">
    
      <h6><span class="th-dot paused"></span>Paused</h6>
<p><span class="text4"><span class="text-averta-light">Interruption of continuous trading. Only order cancellation is allowed. No order matching.</span></span></p>

    
  </div>
</div>

    


  



</div>

  

</div>

</div>

  

</div>
<div class="col-md-5">

  
  

<div class="component row  medium-gutters justify-content-start None ">
