<div class="component react expand-collapse crmt-3" data-is-edit="false" data-collapse-at="alwaysEnable" data-component-title="2026 Juneteenth Notes" data-list-style="default" data-title-type="h3">
  <div path="expand-collapse-elements">

  
  <div class="cmp cmp-text">
<div class="component react text">
  <div path="text">
    
      <ul>
<li>Any <b>day orders</b> entered after the pre-open session on <b>Thursday, June 18</b>, will automatically cancel at the close of trading on <b>Friday, June 19</b>. </li>
<li>June 18th, TAM, TAM (Platts) &amp; TAS: Regular close per each product schedule</li>
</ul>

    
  </div>
</div>

    


  



</div>

  

</div>
</div>

  




  

</div>
