<div class="component react expand-collapse crmt-3" data-is-edit="false" data-collapse-at="alwaysEnable" data-component-title="2026 Labor Day Notes" data-list-style="default" data-title-type="h3">
  <div path="expand-collapse-elements">

  
  <div class="cmp cmp-text">
<div class="component react text">
  <div path="text">
    
      <ul>
<li>Day orders entered after a product’s Pre-opening(s) on Sunday, Septemper 6th are for trade date Tuesday, September 8th and can continue working until their Tuesday, September 8th Globex close.</li>
<li>September 4th, TAM, TAM (Platts) &amp; TAS: Regular close per each product schedule</li>
<li>Tuesday, September 8th: Regular CME Group Globex close for all products</li>
</ul>

    
  </div>
</div>

    


  



</div>

  

</div>
