<div class="component react expand-collapse crmt-3" data-is-edit="false" data-collapse-at="alwaysEnable" data-component-title="2026 Thanksgiving Day Notes" data-list-style="default" data-title-type="h3">
  <div path="expand-collapse-elements">

  
  <div class="cmp cmp-text">
<div class="component react text">
  <div path="text">
    
      <ul>
<li>Day orders entered after a product’s Pre-opening(s) on Wednesday, November 25th are for trade date Friday, November 27th and can continue working until their Friday, November 27th Globex close.</li>
<li>November 25th: TAM, TAM (Platts) &amp; TAS: regular close per each product schedule</li>
<li>November 27th: Regular closes for Metals TAS contracts</li>
<li>Crude, Heating Oil, RBOB &amp; Nat Gas TAS contracts Regular close</li>
<li>Grain, Oilseed &amp; Livestock TAS close early at 12:05 CT</li>
<li>Bitcoin TAS Early close 12:00 CT</li>
</ul>

    
  </div>
