  <div path="text">
    
      <p><b>Normal Hours of Operation:</b></p>
<ul>
<li>FX Spot+ Sunday 5:00 p.m. - Friday - 4:00 p.m. CT with a 60-minute break each day beginning at 4:00 p.m. CT </li>
<li>FX Spot+ NZD Sunday 5:00 p.m. - Friday - 4:00 p.m. CT with a trade date roll at 7am NZT and a 60-minute break each day beginning at 4:00 p.m. CT</li>
</ul>

    
