<div class="component title">
  <h2 id="2026-brokertec-actives" class="title-text none None">
    
      2026 BrokerTec U.S. Actives Holiday Calendar
      
    
  </h2>
</div>
<div class="cmp cmp-text">
<div class="component react text">
  <div path="text">
    
      <p>BTEC U.S. - Actives on CME Globex will observe the following holidays in 2026 which may affect the open and close trading times. All times noted are Eastern Time.</p>
<p><b>Normal Hours of Operation:</b></p>
<ul>
<li>Standard Time: 6:30pm EST open - 5:30pm EST close.</li>
