      <h5 class="crmb-0">CME and CBOT Products</h5>
<p class="crmb-1">Sunday 5:00 p.m. - Friday 5:45 p.m. CT with no reporting Monday - Thursday 5:45 p.m. - 6:00 p.m. CT</p>
<h5 class="crmb-0">CME OTC FX Products</h5>
<p class="crmb-1">Sunday 6:00 p.m. - Friday 5:45 p.m. CT with no reporting Monday - Thursday 5:45 p.m. - 6:00 p.m. CT</p>
<h5 class="crmb-0">NYMEX and COMEX</h5>
<p class="crmb-1">Sunday 5:00 p.m. - Friday 4:00 p.m. CT with no reporting Monday - Thursday 4:00 p.m. - 5:00 p.m. CT</p>
<h5 class="crmb-0">24/7 Cryptocurrency futures and options</h5>
<p class="crmb-1">Continuous trading Sunday to Saturday, 24 hours a day, seven days a week, Maintenance: Saturday 2:00 a.m. - 4:00 a.m. CT</p>

    
  </div>
