<div class="component row  vcr-gray3 big-gutters justify-content-start crmt-4 ">
  <div class="col">

  
  
<div class="component title">
  <h2 id="freeze" class="title-text none None">
    
      2026 CME Globex Freeze Calendar
      
    
  </h2>
</div>
<div class="cmp cmp-text">
<div class="component react text">
  <div path="text">
    
      <ul>
<li>During a Freeze weekend, there is <u>no</u> customer testing allowed.</li>
<li>New iLink session IDs can be built and deleted on the Friday before the freeze weekend.</li>
<li>Details regarding Saturday testing are available in section <b>7 Saturday Testing</b> of the <a href="/globex/files/iLinkSessionIDPolicy.pdf">iLink Session ID Policy and Operational Guidelines</a>.</li>
<li>No customer testing is available on Reliability Engineering and Operations (REO) weekends.</li>
<li>No customer testing is available on Web Data Reliability Engineering and Operations (WDREO) weekends.</li>
</ul>

    
  </div>
</div>

    


  



</div>

    

