<div class="component row  vcr-gray3 big-gutters justify-content-start crmt-4 ">
  <div class="col">

  
  
<div class="component title">
  <h2 id="mep" class="title-text none None">
    
      2026 CME Globex Messaging Efficiency Program Holiday Calendar
      
    
  </h2>
</div>
<div class="cmp cmp-text">
<div class="component react text">
  <div path="text">
    
      <p>Due to various U.S. Holidays, CME Globex Messaging Efficiency Program Ratios for all Product Groups included in the Program will not be calculated for the trade dates listed below.</p>
<p>Please note the <b>Excessive Messaging Threshold (EMT)</b> and <b>Mass Quoting (MQ)</b> are part of the Messaging Efficiency Program <b>but do not recognize the MEP holiday calendar. </b></p>
<p>For example: </p>
<ul>
<li>Presidents’ Day is recognized within the MEP holiday calendar on Friday, Sunday and Monday.</li>
<li>Within EMT &amp; MQ, Presidents’ Day would not be recognized as a holiday.</li>
<li>Friday would be a normal EMT &amp; MQ calculation. MQ is calculated during Regular Trading Hours (RTH) only.</li>
<li>Sunday restart until the early halt on Monday, would be another EMT calculation. MQ is calculated during Regular Trading Hours (RTH) only.</li>
<li>Monday night restart through the close on Tuesday, would be yet another EMT calculation. MQ is calculated during Regular Trading Hours (RTH) only.</li>
</ul>

    
  </div>
</div>

    


  



</div>

    

